A, had. B, have. C, was.

93
00:05:47.833 --> 00:05:49.775
The answer is A: had.

94
00:05:50.917 --> 00:05:53.032
Learning by doing is blank learning.

95
00:05:53.332 --> 00:05:57.195
A, hands-on. B, real-world. C, practical.

96
00:06:00.733 --> 00:06:02.849
The answer is A: hands-on.

97
00:06:03.983 --> 00:06:06.935
Watching someone do their job to learn is job blank.

98
00:06:07.235 --> 00:06:11.051
A, shadowing. B, sharing. C, showing.

99
00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:16.785
The answer is A: shadowing.

